# Day 13 – Iterative Prompting

## What is Iterative Prompting?

Iterative Prompting means improving a prompt step by step until you get a better answer.

## Why is it useful?

Instead of starting over we can improve the same result.

## Example

Write one example of improving a prompt step by step.

Version 1

Write a product description.

↓

Version 2

Make it more persuasive.

↓

Version 3

Keep it under 150 words.

↓

Version 4

Make it friendly and remove grammar mistakes.

